[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kotoba.wasm-exec/real-host-functions gives 22 of the ~26 declared host imports genuine behavior (real in-memory clipboard/keychain/notification-log/append-log, real sandboxed filesystem I/O via safe-path, real java.net.http.HttpClient, real SecureRandom/nanoTime, a real per-topic-id i64 queue, real Ed25519/SHA-256 via kotoba-lang/ed25519) -- wired into kotoba.launcher/wasm-run-result* in place of stub-host-function, guarded through the same fail-closed guard-call machinery kgraph-* already used (guard-kgraph-call renamed guard-host-call, generic)" "only the device-access quartet (pci-config/dma-map/irq-subscribe/mmio-map) keeps stub-host-function -- permanently host/hypervisor-only, matching kototama.tender's identical scoping" "found and fixed a real, previously-undetected bug: 15 capability kinds already in kotoba.runtime/op->kind (all 9 aiueos kernel capabilities since ADR-2607022700, plus this ADR's 6 new actor-host kinds) were missing from kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang's effect-for-kind -- guard-call denied every one of them at RUN time as :unsupported-kind/:malformed-requested regardless of policy, undetected because kotoba's own test suite only ever exercised the static compile-time capability gate (which never consults effect-for-kind) against them, never real guarded execution -- fixed in kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang#12, kotoba's kotoba-lang pin bumped" "144 tests/780 assertions green in kotoba, each new op proven via a real compiled .kotoba guest observing a real side effect (file readable back off disk, real local HTTP server receiving the request, two SecureRandom draws differing, a real queue's publish/poll/take/count semantics across 4 separately-compiled single-op guests sharing one state map -- mixing this op's i32 and others' i64 results in one .kotoba let hits the compiler's WASM type validator, so one op per compiled guest sidesteps it)"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-real-host-providers-effect-for-kind-fix", :adr/related ["adr-2607022700" "adr-2607022900" "adr-2607062330" "adr-2607062400"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607072345-kotoba-real-host-providers-effect-for-kind-fix", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-07", :adr/body "see 2607072345-kotoba-real-host-providers-effect-for-kind-fix.edn", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/artifacts "{:kotoba \"kotoba-lang/kotoba (kotoba.wasm-exec real-op-effects/real-host-functions, kotoba#289) — 144 tests/780 assertions green, clj-kondo clean\", :kotoba-lang \"kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang (effect-for-kind: 15 missing capability kinds registered, kotoba-lang/kotoba-lang#12) — 32 tests/227 assertions green\"}", :adr/date "2026-07-07", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607072345: kotoba wasm run's host-import surface stops being all stubs", :adr/source-format "edn"}]